WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.533
Your experience deserves a clear
introduction.

00:00:02.533 --> 00:00:07.600
ATS Coach AI helps you understand how your
background fits a role,

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.556
prepare your application, and practice the
conversation.

00:00:10.556 --> 00:00:13.933
Explore the complete workflow with an
interactive sample.

00:00:13.933 --> 00:00:16.555
Bring a resume and a target job.

00:00:16.555 --> 00:00:21.049
Review the evidence behind the match, edit
your resume and cover letter,

00:00:21.049 --> 00:00:23.296
prepare application answers, and practice
interviews.

00:00:23.296 --> 00:00:26.667
Each step keeps your own experience at the
center.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.283
The diagnosis explains what your resume
supports.

00:00:29.283 --> 00:00:32.646
Separate exact matches from related
experience and missing requirements.

00:00:32.646 --> 00:00:36.384
Use the educational score as a starting point
for review.

00:00:36.384 --> 00:00:39.000
It does not predict a hiring decision.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.008
Click into the document canvas to edit your
text.

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:45.351
Adjust the font, spacing, and margins, then
review the PDF.

00:00:45.351 --> 00:00:49.362
A matching cover letter gives you another
starting point that you can

00:00:49.362 --> 00:00:51.033
revise in your own voice.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:53.327
Prepare answers using your saved materials.

00:00:53.327 --> 00:00:57.915
Type a question or dictate it, then review a
grounded suggestion and

00:00:57.915 --> 00:00:59.061
its supporting evidence.

00:00:59.061 --> 00:01:03.267
Unsupported details prompt a request for
information instead of invented experience.

00:01:03.267 --> 00:01:05.608
Hear a question through your speakers.

00:01:05.608 --> 00:01:10.290
Respond by typing or speaking into your
microphone, then review the transcript

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:11.071
before submitting.

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:15.753
Live practice adds feedback and follow-up
questions, with your latest application
materials

00:01:15.753 --> 00:01:16.533
as context.

00:01:16.533 --> 00:01:18.394
Job seekers can prepare independently.

00:01:18.394 --> 00:01:22.861
Coaches and university programs can guide a
review using the same explained

00:01:22.861 --> 00:01:23.233
workflow.

00:01:23.233 --> 00:01:27.700
Save the application workspace locally,
download the files you approve, and keep

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.933
a separate set for each role.

00:01:29.933 --> 00:01:32.751
See how the workflow fits your next
application.

00:01:32.751 --> 00:01:36.273
Open ATS Coach AI and choose Explore the
interactive sample.

00:01:36.273 --> 00:01:38.739
Use the walkthrough whenever you need help.

00:01:38.739 --> 00:01:41.909
You review the facts and choose what to
share.

00:01:41.909 --> 00:01:42.613
Thank you.
